        "fill": "#F3F2ED",
        "content": "The choice of mounting the V12 Mercedes engine in a central position has enabled the Zonda C12 to attain high performance levels of torque and power, while achieving overall weight reduction. Furthermore, thanks to the utilization of state-of-the-art composite materials for the chassis and the bodywork, the car structure is highly resistant and light at the same time, while guaranteeing extreme driver comfort.",
